161
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:39,400
Awan met mangikabil itibaro nga arak,

162
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:42,400
itidaan asupot alalat.

163
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:44,400
Nukasta ti aramidin na,

164
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:46,400
